<!-- ============ WHY ============ -->
<section class="statement" id="why" data-section="rich-text">
  <div class="wrap statement__grid">
    <div class="statement__main">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why we exist</p>
      <p class="statement__text" id="statement">Soccer has a way of bringing people together. It doesn't ask where you were born, how much money your family makes or what neighborhood you come from. When the ball rolls onto the field, we are all part of the same game.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="statement__fig" data-reveal><img src="{{ 'singlet-front.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Player juggling in the Kulars Pro Training Singlet" loading="lazy"></figure>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ REALITY ============ -->
<section class="reality" data-section="mission-story">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="reality__lead">But not every child gets the same opportunity to play it. There are talented young players around the world with the passion, determination and ability to become something special, who lack the resources to pursue their dreams.</p>
    <div class="reality__grid">
      <h2 class="reality__sticky display"><span class="line"><span class="split">Sometimes</span></span><span class="line"><span class="split">it's</span></span></h2>
      <ul class="reality__list">
        <li>a pair of cleats.</li>
        <li>a uniform.</li>
        <li>a registration fee.</li>
        <li>transportation to practice.</li>
        <li>access to a field, a coach or a safe place to play.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <p class="reality__end">And sometimes, all a young athlete needs is for someone to <em>believe in them.</em></p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ OUR NAME ============ -->
<section class="name" data-section="our-name">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="name__head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Our name</p>
        <h2 class="display"><span class="line"><span class="split">What society</span></span><span class="line"><span class="split">needs more of.</span></span></h2>
      </div>
      <p>KULARS was created because we believe that opportunity should not belong only to those who can afford it.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="rows">
      <li><b>K</b><em></em><span>Keeping</span></li>
      <li><b>U</b><em>A movement built on unity</em><span>Unity</span></li>
      <li><b>L</b><em>A movement built on love</em><span>Love</span></li>
      <li><b>A</b><em></em><span>And</span></li>
      <li><b>R</b><em>A movement built on respect</em><span>Respect</span></li>
      <li><b>S</b><em></em><span>in Society</span></li>
    </ol>
    <div class="beliefs">
      <p>Sport can unite us.</p>
      <p>Sport can empower us.</p>
      <p>Sport can create opportunity.</p>
      <p>Sport can change lives.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ IMPACT ============ -->
<section class="impact impact--page" id="impact" data-section="impact">
  <div class="wrap impact__grid">
    <div class="impact__num" aria-label="5 percent"><span id="impactNum">5</span><i>%</i></div>
    <div class="impact__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Every purchase has a purpose</p>
      <p class="impact__lede">of every product sold goes to supporting underprivileged football communities.</p>
      <p>When you buy a KULARS shirt, jersey, hoodie, jacket or anything else, you're not simply buying something to wear. You're helping someone else get an opportunity to play.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="impact__list">
      <li><small>Your purchase can help provide</small><b>Equipment</b></li>
      <li><small>It can help support</small><b>Training</b></li>
      <li><small>It can help provide</small><b>Access to programs</b></li>
      <li><small>It can help a young player</small><b>Step onto a field</b></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

